      "description": "The John Lewis experience at your fingertips. Shop new homeware, the latest fashion trends, beauty bestsellers, our favourite gifts and more. \n\nNew to John Lewis?\nCreate an account via the app and begin using our Wish List feature to save your favourite products.  From house moves to gifting, prepare for all life's moments by browsing our extensive catalogue.\n\nNew to My John Lewis membership?\nBecome a My John Lewis member to access exclusive product launches, rewards and competitions alongside saving your in-store receipts to your account - all via our John Lewis app. \n\nAlready a My John Lewis member?\nSign into your My John Lewis account to access your digital membership card as well as personalised app exclusive rewards and member benefits every month. \n\n---\n\nEFFORTLESS SHOPPING\n• Search and browse over 300,000 products; from clothes, electronics, home furnishings and beauty.\n• Using our Augmented Reality (AR) feature you can:\n        • Try on your favourite lipstick and experiment with shades before you buy\n        • View a collection of sofas, TVs and Christmas Trees in your home\n• Share your favourite products with friends and family via a Shared Wish List\n• Turn on notifications to be the first to hear about the latest promotions and seasonal activity\n• Add products to your basket and order in just a few taps\n• Track your orders and retain online and in-store receipts for easy returns\n\nMORE FROM OUR STORES\n• Scan product barcodes to view detailed product information, ratings and reviews as well as similar items\n• Check availability and reserve stock in any of our stores nationwide\n• Click and collect from John Lewis, Waitrose and hundreds of other locations \n\nOUR EXTENSIVE RANGE INCLUDES:\n• Home & Garden \n  - Find all your home essentials\n  - Explore our selection of garden furniture\n  - Refresh your homeware \n• Furniture & Lights \n  - Home furniture for all rooms, including sofas, armchairs, dining and home office\n  - Lighting that encompasses both modern and traditional styles\n  - Beds ranging from Single to Super King size\n• Electricals \n  - TVs from the most renowned brands\n  - Speakers that include both portable and fixed styles\n  - Headphones that are wireless and have noise-cancelling features \n  - Home appliances  \n  - All the latest iPhone and iPad Models\n• Women \n  - Womenswear from a selection of fashionable brands\n  - Dresses for all occasions\n  - Designer handbags\n  - Jumpsuits that are perfect for partywear and summer holidays\n  - Women's shoes which cover everything from sandals to slippers\n• Men \n  - Menswear including all the latest in men’s fashion\n  - Mens clothing designed for the debonair gent\n  - Suits that are perfect for every smart occasion\n• Beauty \n  - Beauty products that include all your necessities\n  - Find all the very latest makeup and skincare products from trusted brands\n  - Pick up your favourite scents from our perfume and aftershaves offerings\n• Baby & Child \n  - A wide selection of toys to keep children entertained\n  - Baby and kids clothes from reputable brands \n• Sport & Leisure \n  - Mens sports clothing\n  - Women's sports clothing\n  - Sports equipment\n• Gifts \n  - Gifts for him that make for ideal birthday and anniversary presents\n  - Gifts for her that include jewellery and her favourite fragrances\n  - Gifts for kids that include games, toys and clothing\n\nTo help us bring you the best shopping experience, we would love to hear from you. You can provide us feedback via the Account tab.\n\nWhen you download the John Lewis app, we process your data in accordance with our Privacy Notice. For more information on this, please visit www.johnlewis.com or you can also access the privacy notice within your John Lewis app.",
